* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Everything `prettier --check` reads under frontend/ (its config sets endOfLine: lf), plus the
# docs. Without these, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF and the check fails.
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
